  "notes": [
    "Victims are the CKTokens 0xa4e9f603, 0x9e0b1192, 0x84821a4a and 0xc8c2292b. Alpaca ib tokens are unpriced and valued at what they redeemed for: 33.4690 ibBNB for 42.058 BNB (0x3ff4fe4f, 0x4bf9bfba), 23,454.29 ibUSDT at the vault rate 1.2104 (28,352.80 USDT redeemed in 0xe8d797ca), 1,251.80 ibBUSD for 1,331.99 USDT (0x7997b952).",
    "The anchor 0x1b42d7ec took only 19.6 USD from CKToken 0xa4e9f603; it is the attacker's first run of the same call. Earlier issueWithSingleToken2/issueWithEther2 calls (2022-2023) carry ordinary weightings near 0.5e18 and real issue quantities.",
    "Reset is CKToken 0xa4e9f603 initializing the module (isInitializedModule), 3 minutes after the module's deployment and after its controller registration (0x9607c783) and PANCAKESWAP adapter listing (0x06890d33).",
